      "id": "GHSA-g233-2p4r-3q7v",
      "summary": "Hashicorp Vault vulnerable to denial of service through memory exhaustion",
      "details": "Vault Community and Vault Enterprise (\u201cVault\u201d) clusters using Vault\u2019s Integrated Storage backend are vulnerable to a denial-of-service (DoS) attack through memory exhaustion through a Raft cluster join API endpoint. An attacker may send a large volume of requests to the endpoint which may cause Vault to consume excessive system memory resources, potentially leading to a crash of the underlying sys",
